Package: vabaxos-books
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: text
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, vabaxos-reader, vabaxos-news
Description: Free books and audiobooks, searched and opened from the keyboard
 Books of Project Gutenberg (through Gutendex) downloaded in Documents,
 folder Libri, and opened in the document reader; audiobooks of LibriVox,
 read by volunteers, added to News and podcasts, where their chapters
 play with pause, jumps and speed; the Italian library Liber Liber in
 the browser. All public domain; Italian first.
